# README media: TUSKWIND. The journey is the demo player pressing real
# buttons; the later sights (a stall, the storm, the hall) are reached with
# cheats, then played or walked into with presses.
shotscale 2
seed 21
game tuskwind
wait 60
shot tuskwind_title
cheat seed 5
botuntil state == 2 400
botplay 240
gifstart tuskwind 3 2
botplay 840
gifstop
shot tuskwind_day
# a stall of the Duchess Auk's
cheat wares 3 5
cheat near 7 -18
cheat shells 14
cheat face 1
wait 2
hold RIGHT 30
wait 30
shot tuskwind_stall
press B
# late in the dream: the sun down and the storm wind blowing
cheat routepct 84
botplay 300
shot tuskwind_storm
# the hall at the end, and the old one
cheat terns 3
cheat hall
hold LEFT 104
wait 10
shot tuskwind_hall
hold LEFT 100
wait 60
hold RIGHT 560
wait 10
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 160
shot tuskwind_elder
# the brawl
game tuskwind
wait 20
press DOWN
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 5
cheat brawlbot
hold RIGHT 10
hold A 34
wait 1
botplay 30
shot tuskwind_brawl
